                          "desc": "\n\n<p>文字的字体系列。</p>\n<p>还可以是 &#39;serif&#39; , &#39;monospace&#39;, &#39;Arial&#39;, &#39;Courier New&#39;, &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;, ...</p>\n"
